    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>近期认识的人跳槽新闻频频，我却不再因此焦虑。</span></p><p><span>和男朋友二闯欧洲：瑞士旅行。</span></p><p><span>生活变得平淡又安心（是因为夏天要到了吗？）</span></p><p><span>2026上半年读了这些书：</span></p><ol><li><p><span>Complex PTSD - from surviving to thriving - Pete Walker 2/20</span></p></li><li><p><span>Empire of Orgasm: Sex, Power, and Downfall of Wellness Cult - Ellen Huet 2/22</span></p></li><li><p><span>The Pathless Path: Imagining a new story for work and life - Paul Millers 2/26</span></p></li><li><p><span>The Dip - Seth Godwin 3/3</span></p></li><li><p><span>活出生命的意义 - 维克多·弗兰克 3/9</span></p></li><li><p><span>The Examined Life: How We Lose and Find Ourselves - Stephen Grosz 4/21</span></p></li><li><p><span>The Serviceberry: Abundance and Reciprocity in the Natural World - Robin Wall Kimmerer 4/28</span></p></li><li><p><span>Designing Your Life - 4/28 Bill Burnett &amp; Dave Evans</span></p></li><li><p><span>记一忘三二 - 5/16 李娟</span></p></li><li><p><span>这世界即残酷也温柔 - 孙宇晨 6/1</span></p></li></ol><p><span>【来看动起来的我】</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/548bee082e1d931551cff59b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=548bee082e1d931551cff59b&amp;apptime=1701033050" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/548bee082e1d931551cff59b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=548bee082e1d931551cff59b&amp;apptime=1701033050"><span>小红书: Claire荆</span></a><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;| &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3719879260" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3719879260"><span>微博：Claire荆</span></a></p>]]></description>
